    "detailed_description": "<strong>Build your own yacht empire!</strong><br>Yacht Mechanic Simulator lets you have a taste of luxury as you renovate, redecorate, test, and sell state-of-the-art yachts of various sizes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/f8bcaab10bb4efb3591711447def4a84.poster.avif?t=1725013041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/f8bcaab10bb4efb3591711447def4a84.webm?t=1725013041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Renovate old motorboats and give them a new life. You can fix them, upgrade them, or even replace them entirely with better ones!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/489b9516f238ba0751f778f0de85bbcf.poster.avif?t=1725013041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/489b9516f238ba0751f778f0de85bbcf.webm?t=1725013041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Repair fractured hulls at your workshop and get to work on any damaged equipment. Edit, move, replace hundreds of different elements and improve your yacht. Turn your workshop into a proper shipyard!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/63b84cb6683e3f170697e9fc13223494.poster.avif?t=1725013041\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1263620/extras/63b84cb6683e3f170697e9fc13223494.webm?t=1725013041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Cater to your clientele by creating gorgeous interiors! Manage decorative elements and turn your yacht into a temple of beauty. Earn money and start working on even bigger and even more luxurious vessels.<br><br>Finally, test your yachts and see how they handle the water. Earn money and start working on even bigger and even more luxurious vessels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Several different yachts to work on.<br></li><li> Various repair mechanics to patch the hull, fix the engines, or change batteries/cables.<br></li><li> Plenty of parts to use, which you can either repair or purchase from a store.<br></li><li> Test your yachts in a special dock.<br></li><li> Career mode with story missions.<br></li><li> Randomly generated missions.<br></li><li> Grow your yacht fleet.<br></li><li> Decorative elements that let you create both cozy and luxurious interiors.<br></li><li> Paint tools and various different materials to use.</li></ul>",
